<!DOCTYPE concept PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA Concept//EN" "concept.dtd">
<concept id="concept_i3k_ccf_y3c">
    <title>The Art of Wine Tasting</title>
    <shortdesc>Learn the 5S method</shortdesc>
    <conbody>
        <p>To Taste Wine, use the 5S method as follows:</p>
        <ol id="ol_x3f_tcf_y3c">
            <li><b>See</b> (check color/clarity)</li>
            <li><b>Swirl</b> (aerate in the glass)</li>
            <li><b>Sniff</b> (identify aromas)</li>
            <li><b>Sip</b> (take a mouthful)</li>
            <li><b>Savor</b> (assess the finish)</li>
        </ol>
    </conbody>
</concept>
